# Trial of the Guildsman (Q216), a second class-change trial, played by a level 36 Artisan
# with the 2000 adena fee and the seven Journeyman Rings it crafts already in its pack (the
# scenario format has no craft step), every script roll pinned to 0: Valkon takes the fee,
# gives his recommendation and pays the level 35 set's Dimensional Diamonds; Altran, then
# Valkon's Mandragora Berry errand; Altran's instructions, recommendations and ring recipe;
# Norman's receipt, Duning's thirty keys of the Breka Orcs, then Norman's list of the seventy
# bone powders, whetstones, pigments and yarns for the Journeyman Gems; Pinter gives the Artisan
# the Amber Bead recipe, and the seventy Amber Beads of the ants (an Amber Lump with the last
# drop) make the Journeyman Deco Beads; Valkon sees the seven rings, hands over the Mark of
# Guildsman and completes the quest; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of
# this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q216_trial_of_the_guildsman.golden
character Artisan 36
class 56
hold 57 2000
hold 3139 7
random always 0
script quest.Q216_TrialOfTheGuildsman
item 3119 3024 3025 3120 3121 3122 3123 3124 3125 3126 3127 3128 3129 3130 3131 3132 3133 3134 3135 3136 3137 3138 3139 57 7562
page warehouse/30103.htm
page warehouse/30210.htm
page default/30283.htm
page trainer/30298.htm
page trainer/30688.htm
page script/quest/Q216_TrialOfTheGuildsman/
npc valkon 30103 WarehouseKeeper 10 0 0
npc norman 30210 WarehouseKeeper -10 0 0
npc altran 30283 Folk 0 10 0
npc pinter 30298 Trainer 0 -10 0
npc duning 30688 Trainer 20 20 0
npc mandragora 20154 Monster 40 0 0
npc breka 20271 Monster -40 0 0
npc strain 20200 Monster 0 40 0
npc golem 20083 Monster 0 -40 0
npc seeker 20202 Monster 40 40 0
npc silenos 20168 Monster -40 -40 0
npc ant 20079 Monster 40 -40 0

